/-!
# Blueprint for APM t03J04 (against `RevisedMain.lean`)

The definitions block and the statement of `apm_t03j04` are byte-identical to
`holes/labs/blueprints/t03J04/RevisedMain.lean`.  Leaves are top-level
theorems ending in `sorry`; everything else is sorry-free.  See `BLUEPRINT.md`.

Abbreviation: `χ(X) = v` means
`ConstructionTargets.RationalLefschetz.HasEulerCharacteristic X v`.
